title: Private writing is important.
pid: 6305389e-733a-4534-acdf-7aafe774904a
body: |2-
  The argument is short:

  - [[id:66b91932-6326-4686-a7e5-fc0140abb3f0][Writing expands the writer's ability to think.]]
  - For most of us, there are things we will not write about if we think someone else will see it.
contains:
